{
  "schema": "pool-game-text/1",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "note": "原文逐字取自 docs/audit/dos-ecl-text-inventory.json；原版 block 不修改。專有名詞依 docs/reference/manual/glossary.md，說明書沒有的另記在該檔的「遊戲內文字新增譯名」一節。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "source": "'BEHIND THESE DOORS ARE THE SPECIAL TRAINING SCHOOLS  WHERE ADVENTURERS INCREASE THEIR SKILLS. LET US NOW GO TO THE CITY'S MOST IMPORTANT BUILDING.'",
      "text": "「這幾道門後面是各種訓練所，冒險者在裡面精進本事。接下來去看看城裡最重要的建築。」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第五頁。訓練所沿用說明書 p.9 的用詞。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'BEYOND THIS GATE ARE THE MONSTER-RIDDEN AREAS OF THE OLD CITY WE ARE SLOWLY PREPARING FOR SETTLEMENT.  THE COUNCIL OFFERS A GENEROUS REWARD TO THOSE WHO CLEAR AREAS OF MONSTERS.",
      "text": "「這道門外就是舊城區，那裡滿是怪物，我們正一步步整頓、準備讓人遷入。清掉一區怪物的人，市議會會給一筆優厚的報酬。",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第七頁。原版這一句沒有結尾引號，照原樣不補。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'GREETINGS, COURAGEOUS ONES, I AM ROLF, APPOINTED BY THE COUNCIL TO INTRODUCE NEWCOMERS TO THE FAIR CITY OF PHLAN. IF YOU WILL ACCOMPANY ME, I WILL START THE TOUR.'",
      "text": "「勇敢的朋友們，你們好。我是羅夫，市議會派我為新來的人介紹美麗的菲蘭城。願意跟我走一趟的話，導覽這就開始。」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第一頁。Phlan 依 glossary 定案作菲蘭；Rolf 說明書未收，見 glossary 的「遊戲內文字新增譯名」。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'ON YOUR RIGHT IS ONE OF THE ENTRANCE'S TO SUNE'S TEMPLE. AS WITH ALL PHLAN'S TEMPLES, VARIOUS CLERICAL SERVICES ARE OFFERED INSIDE.  ON YOUR LEFT IS AN ENTRANCE TO THE CITY PARK.'",
      "text": "「右手邊是蘇妮神殿的入口之一。和菲蘭城其他神殿一樣，裡面提供各種神職服務。左手邊則是通往市立公園的入口。」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第六頁。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'OUR TOUR IS ENDED. AGAIN, LET ME URGE YOU TO APPLY TO THE CITY CLERK FOR A COMMISSION.  GOOD-BYE AND GOOD FORTUNE.' (YOU ARE ON YOUR OWN NOW)",
      "text": "「導覽到此結束。再提醒一次，記得去找書記官接委託。再會，祝你們好運。」（接下來就靠你們自己了）",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽最後一頁。括號內是原版給玩家的旁白，不是羅夫的話。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'WE ARE JUST OUTSIDE THE CITY HALL. PROCLAMATIONS ARE POSTED ON THESE WALLS. INSIDE, THE CITY CLERK AWARDS THE COUNCIL'S COMMISSIONS.  COMMISSIONS ARE THE QUICKEST WAY TO FAME AND FORTUNE.'",
      "text": "「我們就在市政廳外面。公告都貼在這幾面牆上。裡頭的書記官負責發放市議會的委託。想快點成名發財，接委託是最快的路。」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第四頁。commission 沿用專案既有的「委託」。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'YOU NOW FACE AN ENTRANCE TO THE TEMPLE OF TYR.  THERE ARE THREE TEMPLES IN PHLAN: TYR'S, SUNE'S, AND TEMPUS. TYR'S IS THE LARGEST AND HOUSES BISHOP BRACCIO. IF YOU WILL TURN AROUND NOW, '",
      "text": "「你們面前是提爾神殿的入口。菲蘭城裡有三座神殿：提爾、蘇妮與坦帕斯。提爾神殿最大，巴西歐主教就住在裡面。現在請轉過身來，」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第二頁。原版每一頁各自成一段引文，這一頁的句子在下一頁接完，但引號在本頁就收掉，譯文照同樣的斷法。Tyr 提爾、Braccio 巴西歐 依 glossary 定案；Sune、Tempus 為新增譯名。"
    },
    {
      "source": "'YOU WILL SEE THE ENTRANCE TO THE PASSENGER DOCK AREA WE JUST DEPARTED.  FEW SHIPS DARE THE PERILOUS PASSAGE HERE, BUT THE COUNCIL IS DEVELOPING A PLAN TO OPEN UP THE SEA LANES.  PLEASE FOLLOW ME.'",
      "text": "「就會看到我們剛才離開的客運碼頭入口。敢走這條險路的船不多，不過市議會正在擬定計畫，要把航道打通。請跟我來。」",
      "note": "Rolf 導覽第三頁，承接上一頁的句子。The City Council 依 glossary 作市議會。"
    },
